# Molt Tender (G, 1/1): "{T}: Mill a card." Cast on turn 1 and summoning sick, it can tap on turn 3: with an empty graveyard its
# mana ability's cost (exile a card from your graveyard) cannot be paid, so only the mill is possible (the refusal). Milling puts the
# top card of the library, Memnite (the Island above it was drawn for the turn), into the graveyard. The Tender is tapped now: a
# second mill, and the mana ability (which also taps it), are not offered this turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Molt Tender
Island x6
Memnite
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Molt Tender.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Molt Tender.Activate(Ability: Exile a card)
Bot1.Battlefield.Molt Tender.Activate(Ability: Mill)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Memnite
! Bot1.Battlefield.Molt Tender.Activate(Ability: Mill)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Molt Tender.Activate(Ability: Exile a card)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Memnite
Bot1.Battlefield.Molt Tender.Tapped = true
Bot1.Library.Count = 20
